    "Advanced" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "詳細"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced includes detailed call information and diagnostics. Switching layouts keeps your call connected." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "詳細表示では通話の詳しい情報と診断を確認できます。表示を切り替えても通話は続きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After signing in, you can use nearby calls without an Internet connection." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一度ログインした後は、Internetにつながらない場所でも近距離通話を利用できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Call Requests" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通話の呼び出しを許可"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow this saved person to send call requests. Permission is shared when you connect one to one. Receiving also needs notifications enabled on this device. A request does not start a call automatically." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この相手からの通話の呼び出しを許可します。1対1で接続すると許可を共有します。受信にはこの端末の通知も有効にしてください。通知だけで通話は始まりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An active pass is required to create a group or invite riders. Check Access in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
